# Raise the Past: mana value is read in the graveyard (CR 202.3), where the {X} of Mockingbird ({X}{U}) is 0, so its mana value is 1 and
# it returns with Ornithopter (0). Both enter at the same moment (CR 110.2a), so Mockingbird's "you may have this creature enter as a
# copy" finds no creature already on the battlefield to copy (the Ornithopter enters with it, the ruling of Clone) and asks nothing:
# it enters as itself, a 1/1 Bird Bard with flying, not as an Ornithopter.

